WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:07.006
ALBERT LIN: I'm deep
inside an ancient pyramid

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.808
on the trail of a
mysterious Umayyad

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:12.812
dynasty called the Snake Kings.

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:17.384
I'm so far into the heart of the
pyramid, my radio doesn't work.

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:24.858
Within these twisting tunnels,
it's impossible to know

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:27.360
just how deep I am.

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.429
But if my team
can skin it, we'll

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:31.598
find out for the first
time, whether it still

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:34.234
holds undiscovered depths
for Sandra and Francisco

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.368
to explore.

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.843
[coughing]

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.312
It's so humid in here and muggy.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:47.580
I can barely breathe.

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:51.284
Wow.

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.566
Eventually, the tunnel ends.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:14.908
It feels like I'm inside
the center of a mountain.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:18.912
And yet, here are these crypts.

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:22.782
Somebody's life
was lived, and then

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:27.720
this place was built to honor
their life after they died.

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.492
Wow, this wasn't
meant for the living.

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:36.930
This is the chamber
for the dead.

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:38.498
It feels like we
shouldn't be here.

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:42.335
Well, come on, guys, let's
get out of here, get some air.

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:50.276
Hey, you made it.

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:55.215
[sighs] It was just like
nothing I've ever seen before,

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:57.183
you know, like a spiral
staircase descending

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.485
all the way to the bottom.

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:04.290
Oh, what an experience.

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:09.262
Inside, my team
are already at work

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:12.465
scanning the tunnel system.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:15.969
A series of revolving lasers
fire millions of beams of light

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:19.839
every second, reaching every
last square inch of the tunnel.

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:28.648
Later, with the scan complete,
I show Francisco and Sandra

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:29.649
the results.

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:34.854
Are you ready for this?

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:35.788
This is the front.

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:36.990
SANDRA: Mm-hmm.

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:37.891
Ah!

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:39.792
FRANCISCO: Wow, yes!

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:41.294
SANDRA: Oh, yes.

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:43.229
Basically, it's an
X-ray of the whole thing.

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:46.599
Yeah, this is really
exciting for us.

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:50.103
ALBERT LIN: The new scans
reveal a massive surprise.

00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:52.972
FRANCISCO: It looks like we're
2 or 3 meters above bedrock.

00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:55.575
Typically, the first king
gets buried in the bedrock.

00:02:55.642 --> 00:02:58.311
And then whoever comes
after gets buried

00:02:58.378 --> 00:02:59.679
in the building above it.

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:01.347
And so if this is
not in bedrock,

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:03.583
it means there is another
building below it.

00:03:06.419 --> 00:03:08.655
ALBERT LIN: The new data
that we just collected shows

00:03:08.721 --> 00:03:10.623
that Sandra and
Francisco still have

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:13.159
further to go to
investigate the origins

00:03:13.226 --> 00:03:15.862
of this mysterious city.

